```cpp
gsAABB<d,Z>& operator= ( const gsAABB<d,Z>& other )
{
    if (this!=&other)
    {
        first  = other.first;
        level  = other.level;   // `second` is never assigned
    }
    return *this;
}
```

**Example of the failure:**
```cpp
gsVector<index_t,2> lo, hi;  lo << 0,0;  hi << 4,4;
gsAABB<2> a(lo, hi, 1);
gsAABB<2> b;          // b.second == (0,0)
b = a;                // b.second is still (0,0), not (4,4)
gsAABB<2> c(a);       // copy ctor delegates to operator=
```

